# Kagekuni Assistant — Foundry module repo
#
# The main branch holds HUMAN-DIFFABLE SOURCE:
#   - module.json (manifest + pack declarations)
#   - scripts/, styles/, lang/
#   - packs/_source/**  (YAML intermediate, one file per compendium document)
#
# The main branch does NOT hold compiled LevelDB packs. Those are generated
# by `npm run build` (tools/) and shipped as a ZIP attached to a GitHub
# Release tagged `latest`. Foundry's manifest + download URLs point at that
# release asset, not at `main`.
#
# Why: LevelDB files are binary, renamed on every rebuild (000004.log ->
# 000013.log etc.), and pollute diffs. _source YAML is the source of truth.

# --- Compiled LevelDB pack artifacts (regenerated by `npm run build`) -------
packs/*/*.log
packs/*/*.ldb
packs/*/MANIFEST-*
packs/*/CURRENT
packs/*/LOCK
packs/*/LOG
packs/*/LOG.old

# --- Build artifacts --------------------------------------------------------
dist/
*.zip

# --- Local extraction artifacts (regenerated by `npm run extract`) ----------
packs/_extracted/

# --- OS / editor junk -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
